# Build output, including the engine binary. `bin/md-render.exe` used to be
# committed so that a Windows user with no Rust toolchain could run the plugin;
# it is a build artifact and is not any more. A clone has to be built once
# (`cargo build --release -p md-render`, then copy the result into `bin/`)
# before the plugin will render anything.
/target
**/target
/bin

# Screenshots and reports collected while diagnosing a bug. Working notes, not
# part of the repository.
/issues

# insta writes `.snap.new` for a snapshot that has not been accepted yet.
*.snap.new

# Editor and OS noise.
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
